    "crosslink_density": "exact stoichiometric network model; junctions = amine N bearing >=1 active H, each -> 3-functional after full cure; strand unit mass W = M_amine + (active amine H)*EEW_DGEBA; Mc = W/(1.5*n_junctions). Derived purely from molecular structure and stoichiometry (EEW/AHEW), never from measured Tg -> NON-CIRCULAR. Ties to verified EEW/AHEW core.",
